    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>奇物，非普通（+1）</em></p><p>裹着这套布制的绑带期间，你的徒手打击在对抗非魔法攻击与伤害的免疫与抗性时被视为魔法性的。此外，你徒手打击的攻击检定与伤害掷骰获得加值，加值的数值取决于这套绷带的稀有度。</p><p>While you're wearing these cloth wraps, your unarmed strikes are considered magical for the purpose of overcoming immunity and resistance to nonmagical attacks and damage, and you gain a +1 bonus to the attack and damage rolls of your unarmed strikes.</p>",
